        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《100 Day Term》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>——Countdown Begins! Write Your Reform Epic</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍Core Story: Absurdity vs Idealism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You, a youth with zero political experience</strong><br>Become <strong>Chief Efficiency Officer</strong> of the United Spirit of Power (USP). In this absurd world where Congress is a &quot;Stamp Club&quot; and Defense Department is &quot;Over-Budget Division&quot;, you have 100 days to:<br>✅ <strong>Eliminate fiscal black holes</strong>: Terminate projects like &quot;Anti-gravity Chips R&amp;D&quot;<br>✅ <strong>Restore national sanity</strong>: Battle presidential &quot;Greatness&quot; metrics and bureaucratic sabotage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍Revolutionary Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Balance System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Performance</strong> vs ✨ <strong>Greatness</strong>: Every choice impacts real reform vs vanity stats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👑 <strong>President Approval</strong>: Too low = fired. Blind obedience = puppet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛️ <strong>Government Relation</strong>: Expose corruption → retaliation. Over-compromise → failure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120+ Event Chains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Air Tax》Storm: Support &quot;Breathing Emission Tax&quot;? Treasury↑ vs Rage↑</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patriotic Math Crisis: Legalize 2+2=5? Approval↑ vs Education↓</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Data Deal: Trade scandals for visa? Freedom↑ vs Dignity↓</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Storylines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛸 Cosmic Observation: Achieve <strong>&quot;Cosmic Bureaucracy&quot; ending</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛰️ Swamp Ritual: Unlock <strong>&quot;Great Eternal Swamp Saint&quot; ending</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍Character Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day 1</strong>: Sign &quot;No Cursing Printers Pledge&quot; in broken office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day 30</strong>: Confront falsified Performance data - wear &quot;Foam Medal&quot; or resist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day 100</strong>: Become hero/exiled scholar/system saint - your choices define you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍Ultimate Challenges</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>100-Day Countdown</strong>: One critical decision per day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📉 <strong>Data Distortion</strong>: Is rising Performance real when Greatness soars?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ <strong>Rhetoric Decryption</strong>: Dissect traps like &quot;Process Sanctity&quot;</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍7 Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glory? Disgrace? Escape Earth as cosmic citizen? Your fate awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>▍Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*&quot;A <strong>solo dev working nights and weekends</strong> since May 2025. As reality's absurdity outpaces my fiction at light speed, I tip my hat to certain... talents whose spectacle-making prowess dwarfs my humble game.&quot;*</p>",
